      "committer": {
        "name": "Mike Kinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-20T22:11:25Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(import): refuse a STEP item with no unit context in a degree file\n\nThe STEP reader gives a solid item that no representation lists the\ndefault units, so it reads the angles of that item in radians. In a file\nthat states a plane angle unit in degrees, the item had wrong geometry\nand the import gave no warning.\n\nThe model read now refuses such an item by name when a context of the\nfile states a plane angle unit that is not the radian. A built solid is\nrefused, and the unit reason replaces the message of an item that failed\nto read. A file that states only the radian keeps the item.\n\nFixes #3079\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
