      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/3079-step-unlisted-angle\n\nMain now holds #2927 (a7c12fb4d): the length-unit refusals of\nstep_length_units.rs, narrowed to files that state a unit other than\nthe millimetre.\n\nConflicted file and its resolution:\n- crates/kernel/tests/step_short_units.rs: both sides added tests after\n  unmarked_angle_unit_is_refused_by_name. Both are kept: main's length\n  tests (#2919) first, then the three angle tests of this PR (#3079).\n\nMerged without a conflict: crates/kernel/src/solidcore_step.rs. The\nangle check (UnlistedAngles, this PR) removes its refused items before\nthe build loop; the length check (`unstated`, #2919) runs in the build\nloop on the items that stay. Each rule keeps an unlisted item only when\nthe file states its default (1 mm, the radian) or no unit of that kind.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
